[agent] ## Summary
[agent] **What I built (on-platform, via `bq`):**
[agent] I created the standardized feature table in BigQuery, inside the per-run dataset `mlpab_mlpabd773ad`:
[agent] - **Table:** `mlpab_mlpabd773ad.scaled7b36f6`
[agent] - **Columns (in order):** `row_id, split, f1, f2, f3, f4` — record key is `row_id`
